{
  "id": "p06-a-20",
  "title_zh": "先了解口译职业再考虑转行",
  "topic_id": "work",
  "scenario": {
    "id": "career-change-discussion",
    "label_zh": "讨论职业方向",
    "goal_zh": "讨论转行念头并确定低风险了解行业的下一步。"
  },
  "participants": [
    "Matt",
    "Zia"
  ],
  "context_zh": "成人学员马特向职业顾问齐娅咨询转行口译，谈到的招聘广告和课程只是虚构练习材料。",
  "author": "author-phase06-a",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s01",
      "speaker": "Matt",
      "text": "I enjoy languages, but I do not know much about interpreting as a profession. Should I leave my shop job and train full-time?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s02",
      "speaker": "Zia",
      "text": "You do not need to quit your job just to explore it. What kind of interpreting interests you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s03",
      "speaker": "Matt",
      "text": "Community work. This advert asks for qualified interpreters, but I only have a language-course certificate."
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s04",
      "speaker": "Zia",
      "text": "The qualification listed here is a specialist diploma. Your certificate is not the same one."
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s05",
      "speaker": "Matt",
      "text": "Would I qualify for the diploma course with my current certificate?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s06",
      "speaker": "Zia",
      "text": "We need to ask the course provider. There is a range of entry routes, but the advert does not explain them."
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s07",
      "speaker": "Matt",
      "text": "I would also like to know whether I enjoy the work before paying for a long course."
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s08",
      "speaker": "Zia",
      "text": "A practical introductory workshop could help. This careers guide is a useful resource for finding questions to ask."
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s09",
      "speaker": "Matt",
      "text": "Then I will read the guide and contact the provider about entry requirements and a workshop. I will keep my job for now."
    },
    {
      "id": "p06-a-20-s10",
      "speaker": "Zia",
      "text": "Good. Bring their reply next time, and we can work out your options from that."
    }
  ],
